2882	  /* Program all 8 transactions: transaction i reads one payload (up to
2883	   * per_uf bytes) into buffer + i*per_uf.  The offset relative to the
2884	   * page-aligned base carries both the page-select (bits 12-14) and the
2885	   * X-offset (bits 0-11).  Payloads that would run past this iTD's buffer
