 *    EOFs → the bug is in frame delimiting (layer 2),
 *    NOT overwrite: FRINDEX arbitration (B) won't help.
 *  - If many payloads have an INVALID header or odd
 *    lengths, the controller overwrote iTDs before we
 *    read them (lapping) → B is the right fix.
