/* (2) FIFO empty — batch-harvest completed iTDs from the ring.
 * Scan from ring_head forward; stop at the first iTD that is
 * still ACTIVE (preserves chronological order).  Re-arm each
 * harvested iTD immediately so the controller keeps filling it.
